<text>
<p>FRP PROPERTIES, INC.</p>
<p>	   Summary of Consolidated Revenues and Earnings</p>
<p>	  (Dollars in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>	 FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED DECEMBER 31, 1996 AND 1995</p>
